e she  made her first u-turn and proposed they  get married and where they plotted out  their plan to humiliate howard hamlin  seeing it empty but with everything  exactly the same makes you think about  all the things that have happened here  and just how close we are to the series  coming to an end the black and white  brings up the idea of gene and omaha who  we haven't seen yet this season and even  though it's not a surprise i do have to  mention the other short teaser they  released hints that his return is  imminent this juxtaposition of a  location from the bcs timeline in  jean-style black and white muddies the  water about when the happy endings line  takes place in the current timeline  they're in the middle of a volatile  situation that we know at least saul  survives things will likely get ugly  with this new association with lalo so  there could be a happy ending when  that's over the way jimmy's voice cracks  it makes me think that he's talking to  kim which could be another sign that  it's happening in the current timeline  after he gets over the fact that lalo is  still alive everything we know about him  says his main concern will be kim's  safety i feel like any ending that  includes that could feel like a happy  one for him even if it's one where  they're separated if that's what has to  happen of course that would be  devastating for him but story wise it  would also open the door for a reunion  after breaking bad we know the series  will end there the season 6 poster is  gene putting on a jacket that screams  saul goodman and that is the place where  something new and surprising could  happen what that might be brings us back  to the question of what would a happy  ending look like and maybe more  importantly what makes sense for these  characters after the unintended  consequences of their plan and their  previous decisions played a role in  howard's death you could debate the  levels of responsibility but one thing  you can't deny is that if 